<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IMC Global lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IMC Global lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said analyst Ann Kohler downgraded IMC Global Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- NatWest Securities also said it downgraded IMC Global to hold from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- IMC Global said Monday it agreed to buy Freeport-McMoRan Inc in a deal worth about $800 million.</p>
<p>-- in a research note, Kohler said &quot;although we view the transaction as positive to IGL holders over the long run, the transaction will be dilutive to IGL shareholders in the first year.&quot;</p>
</text>
